Package: vellum
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: ffmpeg
Description: Rich Markdown viewer for the terminal
 Vellum is a terminal-based Markdown viewer that renders documents
 with full GUI-like formatting inside a TUI (Text User Interface).
 .
 Features include:
  - Headings (H1–H6) with distinct colours
  - Syntax-highlighted fenced code blocks (base16-ocean.dark theme)
  - Inline images via Kitty/Sixel/iTerm2/halfblock auto-detection
  - Video thumbnail extraction via ffmpeg
  - Link navigation (Tab/Shift+Tab cycle, Enter follows, anchor jumps)
  - In-document incremental search (/, n/N, Esc)
  - Code-view mode (spawns $EDITOR / bat / less)
